	<entry>
		<title>Update on Book Funding / Publishing</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://lancetrumbull.com/news/93-update-on-book-funding--publishing.html"/>
		<published>2011-12-07T06:40:57Z</published>
		<updated>2011-12-07T06:40:57Z</updated>
		<id>http://lancetrumbull.com/news/93-update-on-book-funding--publishing.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Administrator</name>
		<email>everestpeaceproject@gmail.com</email>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;images/stories/everest_beauty_cover_websitesml.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Sample image&quot; title=&quot;Sample image&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update on Kickstarter / Funding Campaign:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, we did not reach our funding goal. I am still working on Plan B, which is of course to find an alternative way to get the book published. The book is done, and it will happen, I guarentee it. Stay tuned...&lt;/p&gt;
</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;images/stories/everest_beauty_cover_websitesml.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Sample image&quot; title=&quot;Sample image&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update on Kickstarter / Funding Campaign:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, we did not reach our funding goal. I am still working on Plan B, which is of course to find an alternative way to get the book published. The book is done, and it will happen, I guarentee it. Stay tuned...&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title>Welcome to Lance's New Site and New Book</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://lancetrumbull.com/news/1-welcome-to-lances-new-site-and-new-book.html"/>
		<published>2008-08-12T10:00:00Z</published>
		<updated>2008-08-12T10:00:00Z</updated>
		<id>http://lancetrumbull.com/news/1-welcome-to-lances-new-site-and-new-book.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Administrator</name>
		<email>everestpeaceproject@gmail.com</email>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;images/stories/everest_beauty_cover_websitesml.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Everest: A Climb for Peace - Children's Book&quot; title=&quot;Everest: A Climb for Peace - Children's Book&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Lance Trumbull's new Website and learn more about his new Children's Book!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- The book chronicles the spectacular journey of 'Peace Climbers' from different faiths and cultures as they climb to the summit of the tallest mountain in the world. The focus is on Palestinian Ali Bushnaq and Israeli's Dudu Yifrah and   Micha Yaniv....&lt;/p&gt;
</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;images/stories/everest_beauty_cover_websitesml.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Everest: A Climb for Peace - Children's Book&quot; title=&quot;Everest: A Climb for Peace - Children's Book&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Lance Trumbull's new Website and learn more about his new Children's Book!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- The book chronicles the spectacular journey of 'Peace Climbers' from different faiths and cultures as they climb to the summit of the tallest mountain in the world. The focus is on Palestinian Ali Bushnaq and Israeli's Dudu Yifrah and   Micha Yaniv....&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
